%% Multi-Agent Orchestrator + CI/CD + Cloud Run/Vercel Deployment

flowchart TD
    %% PHASE 1: Orchestrator Core
    A[Start: User triggers workflow] --> B[Orchestrator CLI]
    B --> C[Validate input & environment]
    C --> D{Check Phases}
    
    %% PHASE 1 Agents
    D -->|Phase 1| E1[LSAS Agent]
    D -->|Phase 1| E2[Pulse Agent]
    D -->|Phase 1| E3[Parso Agent]
    D -->|Phase 1| E4[Gemini Agent]
    
    %% Matrix execution
    E1 --> F[Log output & status]
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F
    E4 --> F
    
    %% PHASE 2 Agents
    D -->|Phase 2| G1[AgentX]
    D -->|Phase 2| G2[AgentY]
    D -->|Phase 2| G3[AgentZ]
    G1 --> H[Log Phase 2 output]
    G2 --> H
    G3 --> H
    
    %% PHASE 3 Agents
    D -->|Phase 3| I1[Analytics Agent]
    D -->|Phase 3| I2[Reporting Agent]
    I1 --> J[Aggregate Results]
    I2 --> J
    
    %% CI/CD Workflow
    F --> K[GitHub Actions Workflow]
    H --> K
    J --> K
    K --> L[Run matrix-based jobs for agents]
    L --> M[Generate status & logs]
    
    %% Deployment
    M --> N{Deploy to Cloud}
    N -->|Cloud Run| O[Cloud Run Service]
    N -->|Vercel| P[Vercel Frontend]
    
    %% Documentation & Monitoring
    M --> Q[Update AGENTS_README.md]
    M --> R[Update IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md]
    N --> S[Monitor via Cloud Logging]
    
    %% End
    O --> T[Workflow Complete]
    P --> T
    Q --> T
    R --> T
    S --> T
